From 02622a3b993ae812d5791b8dfa3da062fedaca3b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: spartanz51 <a.m@tuta.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 12:06:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [sdk] Create a session interactively with a second factor

create_session fails for accounts with a second factor. Adds
initiate_session, which creates the session and returns its pending
challenges, authenticate_with_second_factor_totp and
is_second_factor_pending, mirroring TS LoginFacade.createSession,
authenticateWithSecondFactor and the request polled by
waitUntilSecondFactorApproved. create_session now delegates to
initiate_session and reports a required second factor instead of
failing later.
